From: phlink <phlink@local>
Subject: [PATCH] phlink: make DuckDuckGo the default search engine in every
 region

Reorders search_engines[] in regional_settings.json so &duckduckgo is
the first entry (== default per template_url_prepopulate_data.cc) for
every country. Inserts &duckduckgo where it was previously absent.

102 country blocks updated. Patch slot 0021/0030 of Phase 3.
Refs phlink SRCH-01 (DuckDuckGo default per PRD section 10.1).
---
 definitions/regional_settings.json | 256 ++++++++++++++---------------
 1 file changed, 128 insertions(+), 128 deletions(-)

